d name.\n\n- **Backend:** I renamed the field in `LiveStatus` with the default and description from the spec. The class docstring now says `watching` and `mtgo_watching` are both asked of the watcher object directly. `live()` in `meta.py` passes `mtgo_watching=bool(getattr(watcher, \"mtgo_dir\", None))`.\n- **Frontend:** The Live panel now shows \"MTGO is watched too: each game appears once it ends.\" The Settings hint for a set folder reads \"Each game is read once it ends.\"\n- **Types:** I regenerated `web/src/types/api.ts` with `pnpm --dir web gen:types` and did not edit it by hand.\n- **Checks:**\n  - `tests/test_api.py` passed (212 tests).\n  - `ruff check .` is clean.\n  - `tsc -b` ran with no output.\n  - `pnpm --dir web lint` ran with no output.\n\nI did not run the full `pytest` suite, the web tests or the build from CLAUDE.md's \"Before you finish\" list.", "ttft_ms": 2061, "type": "result", "duration_ms": 57492, "uuid": "893902c8-7afe-4821-b09e-401eb3f48467", "ttft_stream_ms": 1358, "time_to_request_ms": 55, "first_content_frame_ms": 1358, "queued_turn_count": 0, "result_index": 0}
